#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md:11
msgid "4 · Fit the model"
msgstr "4 · Melakukan fitting model"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md:13
msgid "Run the sampler and choose the number of draws, chains and tuning steps."
msgstr "Jalankan sampler dan tentukan jumlah draw, rantai, dan langkah tuning."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md:15
msgid "Before you start"
msgstr "Sebelum memulai"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md:17
#, python-brace-format
msgid "You need a model whose priors passed {doc}`03-check-priors`. Fitting is the slow step: it takes minutes, while every earlier step takes seconds."
msgstr "Anda membutuhkan model yang prior-nya lolos {doc}`03-check-priors`. Fitting adalah langkah yang lambat: butuh beberapa menit, sedangkan setiap langkah sebelumnya hanya beberapa detik."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md:20
msgid "Do it"
msgstr "Kerjakan"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md:22
msgid "Sampler settings go in a `ModelConfig`. The defaults are:"
msgstr "Pengaturan sampler ditaruh di `ModelConfig`. Nilai bawaannya:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md:31
msgid "Pass a config when you build the model, then call `fit()`:"
msgstr "Berikan config saat membangun model, lalu panggil `fit()`:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md:42
msgid "`progressbar=False` keeps these pages short. Leave it out to see the sampler's progress. `fit()` returns a `ModelResult` and also stores it as `model.result`."
msgstr "`progressbar=False` menjaga halaman ini tetap ringkas. Hilangkan untuk melihat kemajuan sampler. `fit()` mengembalikan `ModelResult` dan juga menyimpannya sebagai `model.result`."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md:45
msgid "How much to spend"
msgstr "Seberapa besar yang perlu dihabiskan"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md
msgid "Model"
msgstr "Model"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md
msgid "Simple area-level model"
msgstr "Model level area sederhana"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md
msgid "`ModelConfig()`, the default"
msgstr "`ModelConfig()`, bawaan"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md
msgid "Fay-Herriot offset, one grouping"
msgstr "Offset Fay-Herriot, satu pengelompokan"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md
msgid "`draws=2000, tune=1000, chains=4, target_accept=0.95`"
msgstr "`draws=2000, tune=1000, chains=4, target_accept=0.95`"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md
msgid "Nested groups, many hyperparameters"
msgstr "Grup bersarang, banyak hiperparameter"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md
msgid "`draws=4000, tune=2000, chains=4, target_accept=0.95`"
msgstr "`draws=4000, tune=2000, chains=4, target_accept=0.95`"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md:53
msgid "Use 4 chains, or at least 2. R-hat compares chains, so a single chain cannot be checked."
msgstr "Gunakan 4 rantai, atau minimal 2. R-hat membandingkan antarrantai, sehingga satu rantai saja tidak dapat diperiksa."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md:55
msgid "Check it worked"
msgstr "Periksa hasilnya"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md:62
#, python-brace-format
msgid "A finished run is not yet a usable one. Check it in {doc}`05-check-convergence`."
msgstr "Run yang selesai belum tentu dapat dipakai. Periksa di {doc}`05-check-convergence`."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md:64
msgid "If it fails"
msgstr "Jika gagal"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md:66
msgid "**A setting is out of range.** `ModelConfig` raises `ValueError` as soon as it is created:"
msgstr "**Pengaturan di luar rentang.** `ModelConfig` memunculkan `ValueError` begitu dibuat:"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md:76
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**The data is rejected.** The message names the column. See the errors in {doc}`02-specify-model`."
msgstr "**Data ditolak.** Pesannya menyebutkan kolomnya. Lihat galat di {doc}`02-specify-model`."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md:79
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Sampling is slow or reports divergences.** More draws will not fix this. Raise `target_accept` as described in {doc}`05-check-convergence`."
msgstr "**Sampling lambat atau melaporkan divergensi.** Menambah draw tidak memperbaikinya. Naikkan `target_accept` seperti dijelaskan di {doc}`05-check-convergence`."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md:82
msgid "**The log shows `ERROR pymc.stats.convergence`.** PyMC reports a low effective sample size per chain. Treat it as a signal to raise the sampler settings; do not silence it."
msgstr "**Log menampilkan `ERROR pymc.stats.convergence`.** PyMC melaporkan ukuran sampel efektif per rantai yang rendah. Perlakukan sebagai sinyal untuk menaikkan pengaturan sampler; jangan dibungkam."

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md:85
msgid "Related"
msgstr "Terkait"

#: ../../source/python/how-to/04-fit-model.md:87
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Why fitting comes after the prior check: {doc}`../explanation/workflow-order`."
msgstr "Mengapa fitting dilakukan setelah pemeriksaan prior: {doc}`../explanation/workflow-order`."

